tory\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids in Sherburne County has come in under 90% of normal in September to October in 35 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, October to November ran 55% of normal and June to July ran 143%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 48% on the middle of the grids. Grid 30746 had its driest year in 1976 at 46% of normal.</p>"}
